# A boot image at its most, IMAGE_MAX (padded before its end mark): the
# loader brings all of it, every word: the kernel sums the image before
# anything writes to it (roadmap l4.md L5, E8); the memory for programs
# starts past it (os-server.md P15).
image: large
define: TEST_IMAGE_SUM
---
rx286, test build
rx286: kernel image sum {image_sum}
